    "enUS": {
      "description": "The log is full of meticulous recordings on the comings and goings of Twilight's Hammer forces throughout the Riverglades. \r\n\r\nThe author is nowhere to be found, but this information could help shed light on enemy movements.\r\n\r\nSomeone in Farholde will want to see this.",
      "dialogue": {
        "211e04b1a1f696955d39": "These notes come too late, I'm afraid. We are now well aware of the dangers within Sunnyglade. What's more troubling is that you have found them.",
        "78171e42637d15c6f6e4": "What have you found?"
      },
      "summary": "Deliver the Field Marshal's Log to Demar Brant in Farholde Keep.",
      "title": "Field Marshal's Log",
